; pf-A-agree-06 - expression matrix, AmiBlitz3 case of
; tests/corpus/tests-exprmatrix/pf-A-agree-06.bas: 56 of its 56 cells
; pf-A-agree-06.expect: the output of blitz2-ab3 -r in AB3 mode (the
; port's compiler with AmiBlitz3's libraries)
; generated by exprmatrix expect from
